---
/** Review mark: a hollow dot until the file is read, then a tick. Drawn, not typed,
    so it can't depend on a monospace font shipping box glyphs. */
---

<span class="node__mark" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="11" height="11">
    <circle class="mark-dot" cx="6" cy="6" r="3.2"></circle>
    <path class="mark-tick" d="M2.2 6.3 L4.9 8.9 L9.8 3.2"></path>
  </svg>
</span>
